            "title": "死讯最后压到潇湘馆"
          }
        },
        "chapter_card_fields": [
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                10731,
                10879
              ],
              "lines": [
                288,
                290
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "7b07450675f278ff1efcf644414265baca7a5fb5ebf11844af8c211c73c3dd2d"
            },
            "name": "硬节点",
            "number": 1,
            "text": "**1｜硬节点**  \nR03 / P02：元春必须死；死因、精确日期开放。H03：若死在婚前，必须给后续婚期真实丧期缓冲。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                11356,
                11496
              ],
              "lines": [
                300,
                302
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "066483255f9082bde799f746197e8eef35c721845b3e707ed1da2dfb8c5c830e"
            },
            "name": "人物",
            "number": 5,
            "text": "**5｜人物**  \n宫中传讯者、门房、凤姐/平儿、王夫人、针线房、厨房、紫鹃。不要新增宫廷内幕知情者。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                11769,
                11846
              ],
              "lines": [
                312,
                314
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "92207bfae00af2c70673ed29313e77712e0ffe6d80bfdeb55113a3b3d6635298"
            },
            "name": "宗教/梦",
            "number": 9,
            "text": "**9｜宗教/梦**  \n丧俗可有；严禁元春托梦解释宫中死因。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                12239,
                12319
              ],
              "lines": [
                324,
                326
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "bb5607c725cf69b8205ba4e658e2248688b1a65249bdd5973278007f18bf0c20"
            },
            "name": "应删",
            "number": 13,
            "text": "**13｜应删**  \n任何“元妃一死贾府即刻注定抄家”的直说。\n\n"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "84-S4-F2",
      "description": "不得提前执行86最后一夜、预言黛玉死时，或把饭药器皿强指认为已注册第86回药碗并宣布死亡物态。",
